</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain the relationship between a two-sided hypothesis test and a
confidence interval.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the Bonferroni family-wise error bound using the union bound.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain the difference between FWER and FDR.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain why permutation tests depend on exchangeability or the original
randomization design.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain how optional stopping can inflate Type I error.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
