<p>Investigate permutation tests under unequal variances.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study randomization inference under the potential-outcomes framework.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Investigate power and sample-size calculations for two-sample
