</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study equivalence and noninferiority testing.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Investigate sequential testing and alpha-spending.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study the sequential probability ratio test.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
